    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for sense-perception, sensitive,
			perceptive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				67a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα-κώτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. ἀναθυμίασις</span>, of the
			soul, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αἰ. [τῆς ψυχῆς]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωὴ αἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1098a2
			</span></i>; <i>quick</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					65
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθητικῶς, ἔχειν</span> to be
				<i>quick of perception</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1230b37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.14.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.356
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. ἔχειν ἑαυτοῦ</span>, c.
				part., to be <i>conscious</i> of oneself doing,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				14.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. γιγνώσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.754
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
			<i>perceptible</i>, <i><span class="en">
